{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/d586ax5cwd83rxifpgz6p0obc7y3l58.mp3","text":"博士，阳光与水分都是生长的必要条件，这株盆栽今天已经好好地完成了它的指标，但你好像还没喝够十杯水哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_001.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/rfd86m6liin3wb1d7phd9xtl4q6k56o.mp3","text":"博士，阳光与水分都是生长的必要条件，这株盆栽今天已经好好地完成了它的指标，但你好像还没喝够十杯水哦。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/c14hpkgl7gdlvv14m0j0xuq3ixjozyy.mp3","text":"“我”是谁，答案只在于我所见所遇的一切。就像种子本是死物，落在土里才会发芽。我也曾把自己寄寓在一颗种子里，感受生命是如何生长的。好奇那是什么感觉？做个深呼吸，差不多就是这样。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/75/qvn6702vnoo4axke8f5gfmue15b6qab.mp3","text":"我非鳞，但我能知道它心中所想；你非我，你怎么不知道我在这枯坐一日，没有感受到游鳞自在，河川不息呢？就算你觉得这水缸太小，可谁说水缸就不能垂钓？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/16/l8qiloerox1ugtg1nxpn158n3z0mh1w.mp3","text":"大哥长年驻守边疆，令姐整日抱着酒瓶子睡觉，这个家要是没有我前后操心，早就不能算什么“兄弟姐妹”了。嗯？我当然是姐姐，在十二个里排行第六，就是姐姐。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_004.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/58/7ywjkkr3cx5nqp6z5oxx715ll75spiw.mp3","text":"“我”是谁，答案只在于我所见所遇的一切。就像种子本是死物，落在土里才会发芽。我也曾把自己寄寓在一颗种子里，感受生命是如何生长的。好奇那是什么感觉？做个深呼吸，差不多就是这样。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/86/hekco72i2h3dt6x9q04unqakvexkp44.mp3","text":"我非鳞，但我能知道它心中所想；你非我，你怎么不知道我在这枯坐一日，没有感受到游鳞自在，河川不息呢？就算你觉得这水缸太小，可谁说水缸就不能垂钓？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/fkv4vwlkvcytfti33xkl1r01zkyevkg.mp3","text":"大哥长年驻守边疆，令姐整日抱着酒瓶子睡觉，这个家要是没有我前后操心，早就不能算什么“兄弟姐妹”了。嗯？我当然是姐姐，在十二个里排行第六，就是姐姐。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/0sunk8rorb6crfbuae780j3d60cu0ik.mp3","text":"来博士，把手给我，我给你看看手相。嗯？你这天地人三纹可真是，前身不明，命线四断，去路纵横冲突......原来如此，我算是明白了，你呀，就是个“多生事端，搏一善终”的“普通人”。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/ne79qltetzwb5tebpywfq0ufg7snmuu.mp3","text":"怎么能算是可惜呢？落英入土，滋养根系，来年还会开出新的花；百川入海，逝者如斯，仍能积云成雨，回返山川。即便这大地的尽头是一片雪白，但轮回因果不止，积雪之下，总有春芽新绽。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_006.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/87/5v7mpfquwdqegxjqdd85lq2lw9hdisd.mp3","text":"来博士，把手给我，我给你看看手相。嗯？你这天地人三纹可真是，前身不明，命线四断，去路纵横冲突......原来如此，我算是明白了，你呀，就是个“多生事端，搏一善终”的“普通人”。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/icsjcujdeogeffx0xtuq4u0x7ucd78s.mp3","text":"怎么能算是可惜呢？落英入土，滋养根系，来年还会开出新的花；百川入海，逝者如斯，仍能积云成雨，回返山川。即便这大地的尽头是一片雪白，但轮回因果不止，积雪之下，总有春芽新绽。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/l8fq80jnecko2g7kyyt38qv2582grzq.mp3","text":"小满在教几个孩子玩翻花绳？嗯，这是炎国孩子常玩的。一千年前，我那弟弟刚来大荒城，创造了这种游戏来哄那些孤单的孩子。一根绳子在他手里能变出数不清的花样......是啊，一千年了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/ody24fnhrd53j8k83g09v8y914f4fcu.mp3","text":"博士，我看见前面有个塘子——年，我看到你在夕的杯子里加辣油。咳，乡人们说有大鳞——夕，你在年的饭碗里倒墨水也有些过分了。博士要来钓——还打？......你们两个都过来一下。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/n1j2wbrcgnrrediqwx6g9wrvrypw06o.mp3","text":"你我生命有长短之分，但也仅仅是长短之分。就像只有这艘舰船才能容下这许多人，而那方水洼浮起几片落叶，已足够虫蚁过一生。所聚越多，所负也越重，你我呀，都只是自己天地间的一粟罢了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_009.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/20/n3ro9gmy0xqgipbe1owvqf5l75ef9x9.mp3","text":"小满在教几个孩子玩翻花绳？嗯，这是炎国孩子常玩的。一千年前，我那弟弟刚来大荒城，创造了这种游戏来哄那些孤单的孩子。一根绳子在他手里能变出数不清的花样......是啊，一千年了。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/sg0hodi3ay7xezfj1jums32c6u1iw1m.mp3","text":"博士，我看见前面有个塘子——年，我看到你在夕的杯子里加辣油。咳，乡人们说有大鳞——夕，你在年的饭碗里倒墨水也有些过分了。博士要来钓——还打？......你们两个都过来一下。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/75zgntc0eznaoi8jsn3xtw3mkyjxma1.mp3","text":"你我生命有长短之分，但也仅仅是长短之分。就像只有这艘舰船才能容下这许多人，而那方水洼浮起几片落叶，已足够虫蚁过一生。所聚越多，所负也越重，你我呀，都只是自己天地间的一粟罢了。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/d67zr0h35mmsq6w3zyqkk3pi95zxwau.mp3","text":"东升日头西降月，春寒有雨夏寒晴。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_010.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/87/6nmn5gyy50m8ofbubk85jnzf35hid7m.mp3","text":"东升日头西降月，春寒有雨夏寒晴。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/snmwywozsab3jb88awlqkafllvblpxb.mp3","text":"年应该已经和你说了我的名字，“黍”。长兄长姐和我的两个妹妹都在你这里，我像是回了“家”一样。真稀奇，司岁台那个小伙子居然还没找你们的麻烦吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_011.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/j2ky61n48g3ipu4uigl0o5d7803pl4q.mp3","text":"年应该已经和你说了我的名字，“黍”。长兄长姐和我的两个妹妹都在你这里，我像是回了“家”一样。真稀奇，司岁台那个小伙子居然还没找你们的麻烦吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/ou6b5pbqu01bp9u4je1g88x1edfxeti.mp3","text":"......干戈相向，无休无止，莫种恶果。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_012.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/mz7hfe4ukyz0508lyic24uy6x05g7oh.mp3","text":"......干戈相向，无休无止，莫种恶果。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/cko8xjyq900y6lqgz57gm1778eefwk2.mp3","text":"大荒城以玉琮礼地，敬祈四时安泰，风雨顺遂，那玉琮也是我手中所持的来源。呼风唤雨？在我手中，当然是能的，你要看看吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_013.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/db/hpga7jxjhmjcfzxecs3mnnm1swo0ogi.mp3","text":"大荒城以玉琮礼地，敬祈四时安泰，风雨顺遂，那玉琮也是我手中所持的来源。呼风唤雨？在我手中，当然是能的，你要看看吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/dlxrvpfhokm5v7q8gqiy4ool9t56wc1.mp3","text":"......稻花清香，万亩良田，日复一日，年复一年，终于不再远了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_014.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/73/9r7efjvqez3q4yb5r5vupmpek3pm2fu.mp3","text":"......稻花清香，万亩良田，日复一日，年复一年，终于不再远了。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/8r78nzt7x3n6rhqepbe9znc413aif47.mp3","text":"日丽风和，希望大家可以平安归来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_017.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/3hezkxfjidimcawkpanyh65svonghnb.mp3","text":"日丽风和，希望大家可以平安归来。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/ou45kcxqlm9i9uuy7zsj18vbhyqo2nq.mp3","text":"你们别伤了自己就好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_018.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/81/gddra6l61ke4mavpg4uakvyf8a1opn6.mp3","text":"你们别伤了自己就好。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/tuhnvfpw2w9r27k7fmleb7fzyjh15g3.mp3","text":"莫采恶果。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_019.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/61/1qwyag0xks3dk5h6xjj91tc6kegja6n.mp3","text":"莫采恶果。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/j3z0m90ec20n4gn897bh55i0k4ezya0.mp3","text":"......眼前的惨剧，又是何时种下的因呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_020.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/35a5ir8urmv3r86l6wd4u3zadforejb.mp3","text":"......眼前的惨剧，又是何时种下的因呢。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/t66zc3y1vcpt2yx2e1rhttcyhzit8s4.mp3","text":"唉，原本不该由我出手的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/15/bk0hfo2e8f4073542erqhe8t65tuwxz.mp3","text":"真到了无法了结的地步，就让我来吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_022.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/di42r304p4idglrtobc16d2g7iiiizq.mp3","text":"唉，原本不该由我出手的。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/b7bqkwff5j2q2oosmih53eornt3pcpf.mp3","text":"真到了无法了结的地步，就让我来吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/gy2lqf0fjscda37ua3ztshpkzhu21rm.mp3","text":"春风化雨，正当节令。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/j0ki1zeg60geqndwyuqnrp6uamklm32.mp3","text":"“战场”，真是个久违的词语。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_024.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/jwyf1pqglzbwr9jfaq6w23zlatgqsxr.mp3","text":"春风化雨，正当节令。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/2xmwubg2gefbghwqchxmk1ebc385n3p.mp3","text":"“战场”，真是个久违的词语。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/7pb82s2yld6hc7e7u7a5n5bzc5i43s8.mp3","text":"清明宜晴，谷雨宜雨。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/497cat88elnahrf8f3lnwtcd2oqlvqo.mp3","text":"白露种高山，秋分种平川。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/b12vnjli6yyi8k6xeukvlr7m7sffhod.mp3","text":"枯骨生荒草，丘墟化桑田。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/70/6kgufsvo1israyr9romuluzkorf7qdx.mp3","text":"把你种在土里，你重新长吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_028.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/6l8f9jwj0m0r9nevx81pojr03fjy9vn.mp3","text":"清明宜晴，谷雨宜雨。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/55/6olf0u4s2pxd9je4hqm57enr1386hng.mp3","text":"白露种高山，秋分种平川。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/apgutt40q1gbapz5fi9qkhtnl1qhkla.mp3","text":"枯骨生荒草，丘墟化桑田。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/5fd76n45xru3ktl2q82go8jo8ss8c10.mp3","text":"把你种在土里，你重新长吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/9tas2c7qo6m2ux7xul4bdlag6ahgj84.mp3","text":"谷种入田野，又是一个好时节。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_029.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/3r859f5c00hh2eyjp2p8kkw65864l99.mp3","text":"谷种入田野，又是一个好时节。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/klkvg5387w9cdhlioo94an3d0f0chxo.mp3","text":"不错不错，没想到你有这样的聪明才学。我都有些不好意思让你给我打下手做麦芽糖了呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_030.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/4i034sf99ivzpsmxcfuhw5kzkjtnl4v.mp3","text":"不错不错，没想到你有这样的聪明才学。我都有些不好意思让你给我打下手做麦芽糖了呢。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/bqb4y8lws6isvm3e8i7to4v7oja3id4.mp3","text":"十全十美难求，就如同种下去的粮食会遇到风霜雨雪、天灾虫害，这是过一万年都改变不了的事，尽力就好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_031.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/pl3uonvyoeu2ege3aco3pril7p8g0aj.mp3","text":"十全十美难求，就如同种下去的粮食会遇到风霜雨雪、天灾虫害，这是过一万年都改变不了的事，尽力就好。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/cois6344l68he53lxl1h7p57oa6hzka.mp3","text":"祸福相倚，你此刻种下的未必是恶因，何必灰心？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_032.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/50/8i32cjoncztq5llgpcy4xrebxzkfxj1.mp3","text":"祸福相倚，你此刻种下的未必是恶因，何必灰心？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/kezpl5bfz69o3ibc4l11tlyie4n1lu2.mp3","text":"让我看看，我带来的这些渔具放到哪里好呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_033.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/19/atb79mwrehmdpt7k1fhmyar63x6xumn.mp3","text":"让我看看，我带来的这些渔具放到哪里好呢......","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/lkg0xcqpx2mpju6g5bdt7w638uncpzu.mp3","text":"博士，你也想被种到地里去？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_034.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/15/im5y1n8vpccto5eohug2v2zu5t5vfqi.mp3","text":"博士，你也想被种到地里去？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/c9jsgkf395i1hvwh4jtvbwrgas8ww3n.mp3","text":"嗯？是想和我一起去钓鳞吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_036.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/98/aqhp6fwflc9c6pj6cye3cie26rg5lix.mp3","text":"嗯？是想和我一起去钓鳞吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/awgfyls8zcwdv96becfsehzahrh6z0q.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_037.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/4uw009k22115vitbk66dmjywngszdxu.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/6d5fcxhv4du6omsa91r68yfhq58egug.mp3","text":"三九四九冰上走，一年最冷的时候就快到了，年刚才那一顿火锅有没有让你暖和起来？再不行的话，去向令姐讨杯酒来喝。走吧，我们去外面看看有没有下雪？瑞雪兆丰年，明年或许会有好收成呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_038.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/15/5aa13zcxuqxu7fztlowri8tbblw9n3d.mp3","text":"三九四九冰上走，一年最冷的时候就快到了，年刚才那一顿火锅有没有让你暖和起来？再不行的话，去向令姐讨杯酒来喝。走吧，我们去外面看看有没有下雪？瑞雪兆丰年，明年或许会有好收成呢。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/dmjisrvb5hyfl0v7wqaxmgawhlzghis.mp3","text":"博士，走过来些，让我看看......唔，姜齐城今年种出的作物，果然比人还要高呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2025_shu/cn_042.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/p0ge11d3s34uhnyrhx7mfxhxyc148wx.mp3","text":"博士，走过来些，让我看看......唔，姜齐城今年种出的作物，果然比人还要高呢。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2025_shu_cn_topolect/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/67v9rpx26zvctk5doizebvbwbddb634.mp3","text":"博士，阳光与水分都是生长的必要条件，这株盆栽今天已经好好地完成了它的指标，但你好像还没喝够十杯水哦。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/m775s0m8q5y988gci5nnzn9c7cki99z.mp3","text":"“我”是谁，答案只在于我所见所遇的一切。就像种子本是死物，落在土里才会发芽。我也曾把自己寄寓在一颗种子里，感受生命是如何生长的。好奇那是什么感觉？做个深呼吸，差不多就是这样。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/eod2f9nn3r0p2yz4p90bcohjpvkc7jp.mp3","text":"我非鳞，但我能知道它心中所想；你非我，你怎么不知道我在这枯坐一日，没有感受到游鳞自在，河川不息呢？就算你觉得这水缸太小，可谁说水缸就不能垂钓？","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/d4difrghihjvxp6he6lw4cjk6ufd6dt.mp3","text":"大哥长年驻守边疆，令姐整日抱着酒瓶子睡觉，这个家要是没有我前后操心，早就不能算什么“兄弟姐妹”了。嗯？我当然是姐姐，在十二个里排行第六，就是姐姐。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/7tge7659eu5xxf3g0k5rzzkvgsufqq0.mp3","text":"来博士，把手给我，我给你看看手相。嗯？你这天地人三纹可真是，前身不明，命线四断，去路纵横冲突......原来如此，我算是明白了，你呀，就是个“多生事端，搏一善终”的“普通人”。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/66/s90vw14d4zz606rw7swxlntv84v3qx1.mp3","text":"怎么能算是可惜呢？落英入土，滋养根系，来年还会开出新的花；百川入海，逝者如斯，仍能积云成雨，回返山川。即便这大地的尽头是一片雪白，但轮回因果不止，积雪之下，总有春芽新绽。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/mao6oj2r8ulhohrl7ifqoht57n5sxln.mp3","text":"小满在教几个孩子玩翻花绳？嗯，这是炎国孩子常玩的。一千年前，我那弟弟刚来大荒城，创造了这种游戏来哄那些孤单的孩子。一根绳子在他手里能变出数不清的花样......是啊，一千年了。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/85/hy0ng34ge6kbvbpqghjyvm439wvie65.mp3","text":"博士，我看见前面有个塘子——年，我看到你在夕的杯子里加辣油。咳，乡人们说有大鳞——夕，你在年的饭碗里倒墨水也有些过分了。博士要来钓——还打？......你们两个都过来一下。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/czpc1elpeqe9sxvzqnuhymfp258fv5o.mp3","text":"你我生命有长短之分，但也仅仅是长短之分。就像只有这艘舰船才能容下这许多人，而那方水洼浮起几片落叶，已足够虫蚁过一生。所聚越多，所负也越重，你我呀，都只是自己天地间的一粟罢了。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:2/23/1ny534zcwsbhulji8n1mh0o2g2oq0jd.mp3","text":"东升日头西降月，春寒有雨夏寒晴。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/807etn9wi059juxh39b9ojmx6pyb50y.mp3","text":"年应该已经和你说了我的名字，“黍”。长兄长姐和我的两个妹妹都在你这里，我像是回了“家”一样。真稀奇，司岁台那个小伙子居然还没找你们的麻烦吗？","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/2umfsg02jl0qjr17j8htxq5juffa6eq.mp3","text":"......干戈相向，无休无止，莫种恶果。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/09xvtjutkjuo17hnp4f4mt7rp5xgny5.mp3","text":"大荒城以玉琮礼地，敬祈四时安泰，风雨顺遂，那玉琮也是我手中所持的来源。呼风唤雨？在我手中，当然是能的，你要看看吗？","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/6uc0e7v9gz8uuvul7cezu6kmsa6t3d1.mp3","text":"......稻花清香，万亩良田，日复一日，年复一年，终于不再远了。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:4/48/araw992e3bni48jrghikyvi3tgmonqm.mp3","text":"日丽风和，希望大家可以平安归来。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/spjiuwd4hwdbpf5ycvtzl8dgytg77w5.mp3","text":"你们别伤了自己就好。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/tdzzyaafpr0vzcgtsbc7ky0jeht0plq.mp3","text":"莫采恶果。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/63p3fmkx9ygiuqvu3b9b2t406bwyc4x.mp3","text":"......眼前的惨剧，又是何时种下的因呢。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/egwg867jolobmwzn8lkr1ek0rbqypel.mp3","text":"唉，原本不该由我出手的。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/5bvyraaymhxxkdc0qhs4syvyt0yyrb6.mp3","text":"真到了无法了结的地步，就让我来吧。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/o4ui3xx3eyfk7z8pl644389dw0xhhov.mp3","text":"春风化雨，正当节令。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/39/a9y9w1k01930lw93mg01u60sfd0t85k.mp3","text":"“战场”，真是个久违的词语。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/6qa5i5arth11aktudete51nxhb8uxln.mp3","text":"清明宜晴，谷雨宜雨。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/98/tgmjuie2wxy07fguu5ddjdnwl0vl3yl.mp3","text":"白露种高山，秋分种平川。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/4qpv9mjhpcvnanzcueypbobuh4f1wn8.mp3","text":"枯骨生荒草，丘墟化桑田。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/gxszsqmsx7sxed3x3v2ax9byuvx4diu.mp3","text":"把你种在土里，你重新长吧。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/5khdczsusat209h6qjqbzgo2ma9c3xu.mp3","text":"谷种入田野，又是一个好时节。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/mind6hkduuzgpwsvs6sn1rgi7kj0im5.mp3","text":"不错不错，没想到你有这样的聪明才学。我都有些不好意思让你给我打下手做麦芽糖了呢。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/hrij83hn56z7933ihff3ai7l8ajp4hh.mp3","text":"十全十美难求，就如同种下去的粮食会遇到风霜雨雪、天灾虫害，这是过一万年都改变不了的事，尽力就好。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/5opbtufnieuuyy6bu5k4sls711bju2h.mp3","text":"祸福相倚，你此刻种下的未必是恶因，何必灰心？","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/1hvd00jwlasrxkplnv2inkvppy3s4jz.mp3","text":"让我看看，我带来的这些渔具放到哪里好呢......","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/oklilcq14wmwqubc0vq7kkb1q5tq0os.mp3","text":"博士，你也想被种到地里去？","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/bbhze3vohibje2c4c7lxyp6jotd4ecz.mp3","text":"嗯？是想和我一起去钓鳞吗？","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/p3jncnp356lfrppw99oed4d0szll0bp.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/lga7y7ndt5uvyrdlv84u9adk4kvepw6.mp3","text":"三九四九冰上走，一年最冷的时候就快到了，年刚才那一顿火锅有没有让你暖和起来？再不行的话，去向令姐讨杯酒来喝。走吧，我们去外面看看有没有下雪？瑞雪兆丰年，明年或许会有好收成呢。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/o2onmpnx4hkccsrmvnibhoorupxh9hw.mp3","text":"博士，走过来些，让我看看......唔，姜齐城今年种出的作物，果然比人还要高呢。","alt":"voice/char_2025_shu/cn_042.mp3"}]}}